<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS8" title="In 5. Results ‣ TASR: Training-Free Adaptive Stopping for Iterative Retrieval" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.8 </span>Cross-model analysis: why Gemma benefits most</span></a></li>
